-- want/plan --
move file internal/server/maven_root_test.go -> test/server/artifacts/maven/maven_root_test.go [WEB-12]
move file internal/server/mixed_test.go -> test/server/artifacts/npm/mixed_test.go [WEB-12]
move file internal/server/npm_root_test.go -> test/server/npm/npm_root_test.go [WEB-12]
  git mv internal/server/maven_root_test.go test/server/artifacts/maven/maven_root_test.go
  git mv internal/server/mixed_test.go test/server/artifacts/npm/mixed_test.go
  git mv internal/server/npm_root_test.go test/server/npm/npm_root_test.go
  rewrite internal/server/maven_root_test.go (at test/server/artifacts/maven/maven_root_test.go): 1 package clause
  rewrite internal/server/mixed_test.go (at test/server/artifacts/npm/mixed_test.go): 1 package clause
  rewrite internal/server/npm_root_test.go (at test/server/npm/npm_root_test.go): 1 package clause
  rewrite tools/citestselection/test_ownership.json
note: test/server/npm/npm_root_test.go is now an external test (package npm_test), as every test in test/server/npm is
note: tools/citestselection/test_ownership.json: test/server/artifacts/npm is recorded as shared, so every change below it runs full CI; give it its format as owner once its tests are reviewed
regenerate: make fmt (format the changed files)
dry run: nothing changed
